0813">LongMemEval</a><span>. This benchmark then asks questions over long m=
ulti-session conversations, so the agent has to retrieve the right pieces o=
f prior context before answering. The authors test this across a custom Chr=
onos harness and provider-native CLI-style harnesses such as Claude Code, C=
odex CLI, and Gemini CLI.</span></p><p>The paper also varies how tool resul=
ts are delivered to the model. In one setting, results are inserted inline =
into the model context, etc.</p><p>It turns out that good old grep works su=
rprisingly well!</p><div class=3D"captioned-image-container"><figure><a tar=
